#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:4
msgid "v2.5.1"
msgstr "v2.5.1"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.5.1 is a maintenance release built on Qt Creator 4.0.2 that fixes a "
"false-positive warning in the Dataset Editor's New Dataset dialog. There is "
"no Qt Creator rebase in this range and no breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"v2.5.1 adalah rilis pemeliharaan yang dibangun di atas Qt Creator 4.0.2 yang"
" memperbaiki peringatan positif palsu dalam dialog New Dataset pada Dataset "
"Editor. Tidak ada rebase Qt Creator dalam rentang ini dan tidak ada "
"perubahan yang memutus kompatibilitas."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:13
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:16
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Dataset Editor** no longer warns that an empty folder will be overwritten "
"when an actually-empty folder is selected."
msgstr ""
"**Dataset Editor** tidak lagi memperingatkan bahwa folder kosong akan "
"ditimpa ketika folder yang benar-benar kosong dipilih."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:22
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:24
msgid ""
"Fixed the empty-folder check in the **New Dataset** dialog so the \"folder "
"is not empty, contents will be deleted\" warning no longer appears for an "
"empty folder. The check now ignores the ``.`` and ``..`` directory entries "
"(`4c647a9f7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-creator/commit/4c647a9f7>`__)."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki pemeriksaan folder kosong dalam dialog **New Dataset** sehingga "
"peringatan \"folder is not empty, contents will be deleted\" tidak lagi "
"muncul untuk folder yang kosong. Pemeriksaan kini mengabaikan entri "
"direktori ``.`` dan ``..`` (\\ `4c647a9f7 <https://github.com/openmv/qt-"
"creator/commit/4c647a9f7>`__\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:30
msgid "Platform and tool support"
msgstr "Dukungan platform dan alat"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:32
msgid "**Qt Creator base:** 4.0.2."
msgstr "**Basis Qt Creator:** 4.0.2."

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:35
msgid "Breaking changes"
msgstr "Perubahan yang memutus kompatibilitas"

#: ../../changelog/ide/v2.5.1.rst:37
msgid ""
"None. This release is fully compatible with existing projects and workflows."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada. Rilis ini sepenuhnya kompatibel dengan proyek dan alur kerja yang"
" sudah ada."
